      },
      "heading": "Question 6 (b) (i)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "heading": null,
          "bullets": [
            "This was answered reasonably well.  A significant minority of candidates were not able to correctly identify all three letters.  The site of the Krebs cycle was often erroneously identified as the inner mitochondrial membrane."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
